Dracula Panel for sing-box
==========================

An unofficial, Dracula-themed desktop web panel for sing-box.

Upstream dashboard
------------------
This project is a fork of SagerNet/sing-box-dashboard:
  https://github.com/SagerNet/sing-box-dashboard

The upstream project is licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0.
This fork is distributed under the same license (see LICENSE).

This build is NOT an official sing-box or SagerNet release and is not
affiliated with or endorsed by SagerNet or the sing-box project. The name
"Dracula Panel for sing-box" only describes what this software controls.

Theme
-----
Dracula (dark) and Alucard (light) palettes by the Dracula Theme project:
  https://github.com/dracula/dracula-theme

Additional notice
-----------------
The management module talks to the local sing-box-panel HTTP API, which is
not part of the upstream dashboard. It is an independently added component.
